gpui-pre 0.3.9, modified by the Wormhole project

This is a copy of the gpui-pre 0.3.9 crate, as published on crates.io (Zed's GPUI,
https://github.com/zed-industries/zed), licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE).
The first commit of this repository is that crate unchanged. The commits after it were made by
the Wormhole project (https://github.com/wormhole-terminal) and change these files, which carry
a notice at their top (Apache-2.0, section 4(b)):

  src/scene.rs             the scene's sort: stable without a per-frame allocation (a counting
                           sort by draw order), sprites grouped by atlas texture
  src/view.rs              a cached view records and replays its accessibility nodes; tests
  src/window.rs            the same for elements drawn through `deferred`; the test-support
                           methods simulate_a11y_active, simulate_a11y_action and
                           last_a11y_tree_update
  src/window/a11y.rs       recording (mark, capture), replaying and reusing action listeners
  src/window/a11y/debug.rs the last tree update, for tests

Nothing else is changed: not the version, the dependencies, or the other files. The changes are
meant to go upstream; see README.md.
